      "title": "LianYuyuyuyuyu/dsh-my-prompt-polish",
      "description": {
        "en": "A polish button in the DSH composer: rewrites the draft with a rule you write yourself and a model you pick, then puts the original back on a second click. Nothing is sent, and it refuses to replace a draft that changed, or one holding @ references.",
        "zh": "DSH 输入框里的润色按钮：用你自己写的规则和你选的模型改写草稿，再点一下退回原文。不发送；草稿中途变了、或带 @ 引用时它拒绝替换。"
      },
